&lt;h2 id="about-the-workshop" class="relative group"&gt;About the workshop &lt;span class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100"&gt;&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700" style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#about-the-workshop" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this workshop, participants learned the basics of Sonic Pi, a tool for creating music and live performance with code. By the end, they could create their own piece of music.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>